83: // EnsureStorageLayout creates the directory structures required for repo-memory storage.
84: // It creates the data directory layout for repoID in dataDir.
85: // If repoRoot is optionally provided as a 3rd parameter, it also creates the .memory layout in repoRoot.
86: // It is idempotent.
87: func EnsureStorageLayout(dataDir, repoID string, repoRoot ...string) error {
